title: "Social Computing & HCI Best Paper Awards"
abstract: >-
  A source-linked index of Best Paper-class awards (2015-2025) across social
  computing, human-computer interaction, web science, computational social
  science, and online community research venues (CHI, CSCW, ICWSM, WebSci,
  IC2S2, WWW, SocInfo, GROUP, HCOMP, CHIIR, UIST, DIS, IMWUT/UbiComp, WSDM,
  KDD, AAMAS).
